<title>POLAND: Olawa revised 96 net down at PLN 1.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Olawa revised 96 net down at PLN 1.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olawa SA preliminary results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    operating				  4.45 vs    4.39</p>
<p>    pre-tax				    4.77 vs    5.01</p>
<p>    net					  1.60 vs    3.06</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Huta Olawa SA. In its Q4 reported it showed a 1996 net of 3.02 million and a pre-tax profit of 5.28 million zlotys.</p>
<p>    net sales				 48.74 vs   42.00</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  40.45 vs   34.87</p>
<p>    extraordinary			    0.00 vs    0.03</p>
<p>    income tax				 3.13 vs    1.87</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.04 vs    0.09</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.93 vs    2.77</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.61 vs    2.17</p>
<p>    investment				 3.15 vs    0.34</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
